    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own weapons!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different weapon types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color wheel for precise colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632100/extras/a551334b3f8ffc9d3cba549d4543cf4e.poster.avif?t=1751011068\" width=616 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632100/extras/a551334b3f8ffc9d3cba549d4543cf4e.webm?t=1751011068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632100/extras/a551334b3f8ffc9d3cba549d4543cf4e.mp4?t=1751011068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strengthen your equipment and find new ones!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinforce weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change weapon skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match armors and bracelets for different builds.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight your way to the surface!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different areas with different enemies and environmental hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different challenging bosses which 5 are optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
